# Play a cart from the shelf with the real keys. Safe to run on any cabinet, any number of times.
wait shelf
shot shelf
press down
shot shelf-moved
press a
# G0: how to play comes before every game.
wait howto
shot howto
press a
wait play
sleep 1500
shot game-title
press a
sleep 1000
shot game-playing
hold left 500
shot game-after-hold
press esc
sleep 800
shot left-the-game
